<title>UK: Lloyds TSB raises rates to 6.0 percent.</title>
<headline>Lloyds TSB raises rates to 6.0 percent.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lloyds TSB Group said on Wednesday it is raising its base rates from 5.75 percent to 6.0 percent following a similar increase by the Bank of England.</p>
<p>The Lloyds decision is identical to moves by Barclays, NatWest and Royal Bank of Scotland.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
